xflow vocabulary packs (dev.tsv, corp.tsv, sheet.tsv, finance.tsv)

Written by hand for xflow. Each row is a product, company, function or term
name (a short fact), how speech-to-text mis-hears it, and neighbouring words.
No source file was imported, and no documentation text, descriptions, glossary
definitions or taxonomy labels were copied. The IFRS and US GAAP XBRL
taxonomies were not used.

Everyday-word and name checks in the tests use SCOWL; see ../SCOWL-LICENSE.txt.
english-extra.txt is test-only (never compiled into xflow): SCOWL 2020.12.07
(https://downloads.sourceforge.net/project/wordlist/SCOWL/2020.12.07/scowl-2020.12.07.tar.gz)
english, american and british words up to size 70 and upper/proper-names up to
size 95, plus a hand-written supplement of modern words and short names, minus
../words.txt and ../names.txt; lowercase ASCII, front-coded like ../words.txt.
review-prose.txt holds sentences written for the PR #113 reviews.
